*** Settings ***
Documentation       Generic checks of e-mails - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/email_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Email Should Include Text
    [Documentation]    Checks that the text of the e-mail includes the expected text.
    [Arguments]    ${email}    ${expected}
    ${text}    Read Email Text    ${email}
    Should Contain    ${text}    ${expected}

Email Should Include Link
    [Documentation]    Checks that the e-mail contains a link starting with the address.
    [Arguments]    ${email}    ${address}
    ${links}    Read Links In Email    ${email}
    Should Contain Match    ${links}    ${address}*
